# ---- Keep the two small preprocessing models ----
# data_utils/process.py cannot run without these, so a fresh clone would have
# no working data pipeline. Listed last because the later rule wins and the
# *.tar entry above would otherwise re-ignore the landmark checkpoint. 8 MB.
!SyncTalk_2D/data_utils/scrfd_2.5g_kps.onnx
!SyncTalk_2D/data_utils/checkpoint_epoch_335.pth.tar
